# Critical, not just for image size: locally-built node_modules/dist carry
# Windows-compiled native addons (better-sqlite3) and stale build output that
# must not end up in the Linux image — apps/api/Dockerfile does a fresh
# `npm ci` + `turbo build` instead.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
.next
**/.next
.turbo

.git
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo

# env files and secrets — never bake these into an image layer
.env
.env.local
.env*.local

# Garmin health data (garmy's local SQLite mirror)
*.db
*.db-journal

.DS_Store
npm-debug.log*
